<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine to issue T-bills on Feb 25.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to issue T-bills on Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's central bank will auction all maturities of discount Treasury bills on February 25, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>    maturity (months)	   three    six     nine	12</p>
